<title>LITHUANIA: LITHUANIA-KLOVAINIAI REPORTS RISING NET PROFIT IN H1 97.</title>
<headline>LITHUANIA-KLOVAINIAI REPORTS RISING NET PROFIT IN H1 97.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The first half of 1997,</p>
<p>		    (million litas unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		    477,000	   vs 128,000</p>
<p>    Turnover			4.217	     vs 3.379</p>
<p>    Operating costs	     3.259	     vs 2.765</p>
<p>    Gross profit		  957,000	   vs 615,000</p>
<p>    Operating profit	    476,000	   vs 208,000</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit		477,000	   vs 184,000</p>
<p>NOTE -- Klovainiu Skalda is listed on the A group</p>
<p>of the Vilnius bourse.</p>
<p>-- Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 518</p>
